 "remarks": "The best of brand-new living, ready for immediate occupancy! Set on 1.4+ level acres in Greenwich's coveted Bailiwick Association, this 5,400+ SF transitional Colonial offers exceptional craftsmanship and natural light. A double-height foyer leads to elegant living and dining rooms opening to expansive decks and patios. The chef's kitchen features double islands, Sub-Zero/Wolf appliances and a butler's pantry, plus a vaulted breakfast area and family room. A first-floor ensuite bedroom offers deck access. Upstairs, the primary suite features vaulted ceilings, a fireplace, two walk-in closets and a marble bath. Three additional bedrooms, an office and two bathrooms complete the second floor. Oversized three-car garage. Minutes to Glenville, Greenwich Avenue and the train. Not to be missed!",
